---
title: "Youth alpinism"
---

### **The educational value of the mountains**

We try to offer fun and unusual activities, far from the usual ready-made entertainment, where young people can find ideas to use in everyday life and grow up a little.

Climbing trails with backpacks, learning to manage fatigue while enjoying the walk, the surroundings and the company. Discovering that a group has its rules, which means some personal sacrifices and a few whims to overcome. Fun and difficulty mix with the surprise of making it to the goal.

In the mountains you have to use your head, follow simple rules, trust others and take on responsibilities.

A great training ground for young people.

##### **Activities:**

We work with the Youth Centres, the primary schools and the parish youth club (Oratorio) of Scanzorosciate, and we are happy to work with other associations. We organise walks, sport climbing sessions and overnight stays in mountain huts.
